{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And they said.</b> The priests and the heads of the tribes who were near him — they spoke with him, after the Ten Statements were completed, for they were so fearful, for they feared that HaShem would continue speaking with them and they would die, and on account of this Moses said to them, \"Do not fear.\""], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:36:20.168004286Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}